    "summary": "The user asks for a detailed customer persona and a marketing to-do list for an ultra-premium watch brand. The assistant responds by defining the ideal client as \"The Connoisseur Heir,\" characterized as a male over 50 from \"old-money families\" or as an \"industrial titan.\"",
